        "locator": {
          "block_index": 3,
          "component_id": "cba909eb-6ddb-5373-8299-dc828529a10f",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 478,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.130:block:3",
          "start": 294
        },
        "quote": "(c) “Appearance bond” means an undertaking, with or without security, entered into by a person in custody by which the person is bound to comply with the conditions of the undertaking.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.130:block:3#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.40.130 block 4",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 4,
          "component_id": "aafb6431-b2b1-5133-a77e-286a552182b0",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 767,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.130:block:4",
          "start": 479
        },
        "quote": "(d) “Arraignment” means the formal act of calling the person accused of violating an ordinance before the Municipal Court to inform the person of the offense with which the person is charged, to ask the person whether the person is guilty or not guilty and, if guilty, to impose sentence.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.130:block:4#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.40.130 block 5",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 5,
          "component_id": "39c7f715-18e8-5cb2-add1-377758596b3d",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 955,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.130:block:5",
          "start": 768
        },
        "quote": "(e) “Arrest” means the taking of a person into custody in order that the person will appear to answer for the violation of an ordinance. The giving of a notice to appear is not an arrest.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.130:block:5#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.40.130 block 6",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 6,
          "component_id": "a0699285-74e3-5612-96d5-8ef76f4cafaa",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1065,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.130:block:6",
          "start": 956
        },
        "quote": "(f) “Bail” is the security given for the purpose of insuring compliance with the terms of an appearance bond.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.130:block:6#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.40.130 block 7",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 7,
          "component_id": "e8a48252-7011-52c7-b576-5ee73ad82115",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1207,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.130:block:7",
          "start": 1066
        },
        "quote": "(g) “City Attorney” means any attorney who represents the City in the prosecution of an accused person for the violation of a City ordinance.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.130:block:7#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.40.130 block 8",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 8,
          "component_id": "e0197f1c-74d6-521b-b065-58f1f1f26db6",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1693,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.130:block:8",
          "start": 1208
        },
        "quote": "(h) “Complaint” means a sworn written statement, or a written statement by a law enforcement officer, the City Attorney or an Assistant City Attorney, an animal control officer, a parking control officer as specifically authorized by TMC 10.60.350 , a property maintenance inspector as specifically authorized by TMC 10.25.010 and 10.60.120 or a Fire Department employee with authority to enforce the fire code that recites the essential facts constituting a violation of an ordinance.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.130:block:8#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.40.130 block 9",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 9,
          "component_id": "7034b697-71f6-5c0e-83fe-799619d1a3ed",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1762,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.130:block:9",
          "start": 1694
        },
        "quote": "(i) “Custody” means the restraint of a person pursuant to an arrest.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.130:block:9#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.40.130 block 10",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 10,
          "component_id": "59b19d40-7aab-5f5f-99d3-fdbb17624aa2",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1850,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.130:block:10",
          "start": 1763
        },
        "quote": "(j) “Detention” means the temporary restraint of a person by a law enforcement officer.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.130:block:10#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.40.130 block 11",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 11,
          "component_id": "3a2f9565-0b43-5c74-9a43-62f754bf22ca",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2539,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.130:block:11",
          "start": 1851
        },
        "quote": "(k) “Law enforcement officer” means any person who by virtue of office or public employment is vested by law with a duty to maintain public order and to make arrests for violation of the laws of the State of Kansas or ordinances of any municipality thereof. For the purposes of signing and serving a uniform complaint and notice to appear or a subpoena, the term shall also mean the City Attorney or an Assistant City Attorney, an animal control officer, a parking control officer as specifically authorized by TMC 10.60.350 , a property maintenance inspector as specifically authorized by TMC 10.25.010 and 10.60.120 or a Fire Department employee with authority to enforce the fire code.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.130:block:11#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.40.130 block 12",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 12,
          "component_id": "b999dcd4-12c6-5665-aece-f5755f994f8c",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2756,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.130:block:12",
          "start": 2540
        },
        "quote": "(l) “Legal entity” means a business trust, corporation, limited partnership, limited liability partnership, limited liability company and a foreign covered entity, as defined in K.S.A. 17-7902 and amendments thereto.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.130:block:12#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.40.130 block 13",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 13,
          "component_id": "44037037-d417-5bd3-b6f5-7e51becc482b",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2955,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.130:block:13",
          "start": 2757
        },
        "quote": "(m) “Notice to appear” is a written notice to a person accused by a complaint of having violated an ordinance of a City to appear at a stated time and place to answer to the charge of the complaint.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.130:block:13#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.40.130 block 14",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 14,
          "component_id": "34664445-4886-59fc-8d97-e916d77ba345",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 3149,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.130:block:14",
          "start": 2956
        },
        "quote": "(n) “Ordinance cigarette or tobacco infraction” is a violation of an ordinance that proscribes the same behavior as proscribed by subsection (m) or (n) of K.S.A. 79-3321 and amendments thereto.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.130:block:14#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.40.130 block 15",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 15,
          "component_id": "4d51f6f5-95f0-500e-a81c-ff877c87fb4a",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 3401,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.130:block:15",
          "start": 3150
        },
        "quote": "(o) “Ordinance traffic infraction” is a violation of an ordinance that proscribes or requires the same behavior as that proscribed or required by a statutory provision that is classified as a traffic infraction in K.S.A. 8-2118 and amendments thereto.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.130:block:15#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.40.130 block 16",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 16,
          "component_id": "316d0c05-63f2-594a-bb55-15aeaaacdbb5",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 3531,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.130:block:16",
          "start": 3402
        },
        "quote": "(p) “Resident agent” is the representative of a legal entity appointed pursuant to K.S.A. 17-7901 et seq. and amendments thereto.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.130:block:16#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.40.130 block 17",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 17,
          "component_id": "6b16cebc-9bb2-5da1-854c-703292eb1b10",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 3776,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.130:block:17",
          "start": 3532
        },
        "quote": "(q) “Show cause order” is a process issued by the court to require a resident agent or other representative of a legal entity to appear and give testimony regarding whether the court should proceed to trial and judgment without further process.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.130:block:17#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 2.40.130 block 18",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 18,
          "component_id": "80c72ddc-386d-533c-81fe-678a3e556cd2",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 3911,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.130:block:18",
          "start": 3777
        },
        "quote": "(r) “Subpoena” is a process issued by the court to cause a witness to appear and give testimony at a time and place therein specified.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.130:block:18#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
