          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.130:block:19",
          "start": 3912
        },
        "quote": "(s) “Warrant” is a written order made by a Municipal Judge directed to any law enforcement officer commanding the officer to arrest the person named or described in it. (Ord. 20605 § 1, 10-14-25. Formerly 2.110.130.)",
